        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mumazuba aa-Amarafele mwami wa-Sinara, Arioki mwami wa-Elasara, Kedorelaomere mwami wa-Elamu, a-Tidala mwami wa-Goimu, ",
          "type": "text",
